      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia yali agheza emyaka munaana egy'obukulu ghe yafuukira kyabazinga wa Buyudaaya. Era yaafuga okumala entangama ya myaka amakumi asatu na mulala mu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia oyo yaakolanga ebituufu Musengwa Katonda by'asiima, yaajiira ku mpisa enkalamu edha dhaadha we Daudi, yaaloba kukyuka kudhireka kwira eno oba ere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga Yosia bweyali ng'akaali muto, mu mwaka gwe ogwomunaana nga n'afuga Buyudaaya, yaatoolera okusinza Katonda wa dhaadha we Daudi. Era mu mwaka gwe ogweikumi n'ebiri yaatoolera okugogola mu Buyudaaya ni mu Yerusalemu, okumalamu ebifo ebigulumivu eby'okusinzizaamu, n'ebifaananie eby'omusambwa omukazi Ashera, n'ebifaananie ebindi ebibaadhe n'ebyo ebyakolebwa mu kyuma ekisaanuusiibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.21.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bakyab 21:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.33.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byom 33:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Baamenhamenha alutaari edh'omusambwa Baali nga Yosia aligho mwene, baatematema ni alutaari edh'okuniokezebwaku obubbaani edhaali ghaigulu gh'edho. Baamulungula ebifaananie eby'omusambwa omukazi Ashera, n'ebifaananie ebindi ebibaadhe, n'ebyo ebyakolebwa mu kyuma ekisaanuusiibwa, baabisa byafuuka nkungu era enkungu eyo baagimansira ku magombe g'abo abaaghangayo emisengo y'ebifaananie ebyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakyab 13:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Baayokera ku alutaari edho amagumba ga bakabona abaadhisinzizangaku. Mu nsambo eyo, Yosia yaagogola Buyudaaya ni Yerusalemu, byafuuka birongoofu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaakola atyo ni mu bibuga bya Manasse, n'ebya Efuraimu, n'ebya Simeoni, okutuukira irala ni mu Nafutali, ni mu bifo ebyazikirizibwa ebibyezungulwire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamenhamenha alutaari, yaamulungula ebifaananie eby'omusambwa omukazi Ashera, n'ebifaananie ebindi, yaabisa byafuuka nkungu. Yaatematema n'alutaari dhoonadhoona edhiniokezebwaku obubbaani mu Isiraeli yoonayoona, memale yaira e Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ogweikumi n'omunaana (18) nga kyabazinga Yosia n'afuga Buyudaaya, kyabazinga Yosia oyo bwe yamala okugogola ensi eyo n'eisinzizo n'abifuula ebirongoofu, yaatuma omughandiisi we Shafani mutabane wa Azalia, ni Maaseia omufuzi w'ekibuga, ni Yoa mutabane wa Yoahazi omukuumi w'ebighandiiko. Yaabakoba baje balongoose eisinzizo lya Musengwa Katonda we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baaja eri Hilikia Omukulu wa Bakabona, baaghaayo empiiya edhaaleetebwa mu isinzizo, Abalevi abaigazi b'omulyango ogwingira mu isinzizo, dhe baasoloza ku bantu ba Manasse, n'aba Efuraimu, n'ab'ebiketezo ebindi byonabyona ebya Isiraeli, n'aba Yuda, n'aba Benjamini, n'ab'omu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baadhigemya abakozi abaalabiriranga omulimo ogw'okulongoosa eisinzizo, ate abo baadhighaayo okulongoosa eisinzizo lya Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baadhisasula ababaadhi n'abazimbi n'abatemi b'amabaale, baguleku embaawo n'amabaale amateme, n'emiti, balongoose endhu bakyabazinga ba Buyudaaya dhe baaleka agho ni dhoonooneka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasaadha abo baakola omulimo n'obwesigwa, nga balabirirwa Abalevi bano: Yahathi ni Obadia ab'oku nda ya Merari, ni Zekaria ni Meshullamu ab'oku nda ya Kohathi. Abalevi boonaboona baali bakugu mu bivuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalevi abandi baalabiriranga abo abeetwikanga ebintu, era baakozesanga n'abo boonaboona abaakolanga emirimo egya buli ngeri. Ate abandi baabanga baghandiisi, bakulembeze, oba baigazi ba miryango.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe baali batoolayo empiiya edhaaleetebwa mu isinzizo, Hilikia kabona yaazuula ekitabo ky'Amateeka, Musengwa Katonda ge yagha ng'abita mu Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Hilikia oyo yaakoba Shafani omughandiisi ati: “Nzwire ekitabo ky'Amateeka mu isinzizo.” Yaakigha Shafani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shafani yaakitwala eri kyabazinga, era yaamukobera ati: “Abagheereza bo bakoze byonabyona bye walagira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batoireyo empiiya dhe baagaine mu isinzizo, baadhigemya abo abali kulabirira omulimo ogw'okulongoosa eisinzizo lya Musengwa Katonda eryo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era Shafani yaakoba kyabazinga ati: “Hilikia kabona ampaire ekitabo.” Agho yaakisomeramu kyabazinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kyabazinga bwe yawulira ebyasomwa mu kitabo ky'Amateeka, yaakanulamu ebivaalo bye olw'okunakughala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaagha ekiragiro eri Hilikia, ni Ahikamu mutabane wa Shafani, ni Abudoni mutabane wa Mika, ni Shafani omughandiisi, ni Asaia omugheereza wa kyabazinga. Yaabakoba ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Muje mwebuuze ku Musengwa Katonda ku lwange ni ku lw'abo abaasigalagho mu Isiraeli ni mu Buyudaaya, ebigema ku ebyo ebighandiikiibwa mu kitabo kino ekizuuliibwa. Obusungu bwa Musengwa Katonda buli kututumbukiraku ng'oti muliro, kuba badhaadha baife tibaagondera bibono bya Musengwa Katonda ebiri mu kitabo kino, ni babikoleraku nga bwe byali n'okukolerwaku.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Hilikia n'abo kyabazinga be yatuma, baaja eri Huluda omulanzi omukazi, muka Shallumu. Shallumu oyo yali mutabane wa Tokathi era mwidhukulu wa Hasara. Omukazi oyo yabanga mu kiketezo ekiyaaka ekya Yerusalemu, era nga iba oyo Shallumu n'akuuma eiterekero ly'ebivaalo eby'omu isinzizo. Agho baayogera n'omukazi oyo ku nsonga eyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaabakoba ati: “Musengwa Katonda, Katonda wa Isiraeli akoba ati, ‘Omuntu abatumye ye ndi mumukobe muti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda akoba ati, ebikolimo ebyogerwaku mu kitabo kino kye basomeire kyabazinga wa Buyudaaya, nja kubituusa ku kifo kino ni ku bantu baamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga bwe banviireku ni baniokeza obubbaani eri emisambwa, ni bansungughaza n'ebyo byonabyona bye bakoze, obusungu bwange bwidha kutumbukira ku kifo kino ng'oti muliro, era tibulizikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye kyabazinga wa Buyudaaya, abatumye okuneebuuzaaku, mumukobe muti nze Musengwa Katonda, Katonda wa Isiraeli nkoba nti, bw'owuliire ebyo ebighandiikiibwa mu kitabo ekyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "weeneniiza era weewombeeka mu maiso gange. Era okanwiremu ebivaalo byo olw'okunakughala era waalira amaziga, bw'owuliire ebibono bye nayogera ku kifo kino ni ku bantu abakibaamu. Kale ni mpuliire okusaba kwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era bona eno, ndikutwala weeyimba ku badhaadha bo abaafa, waaziikibwa mu miraala, waaloba kubona ku kabi ke ndituusa ku kifo kino ni ku bantu abakibaamu.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abasaadha bairayo baakobera kyabazinga obukwenda obwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kyabazinga Yosia yaayetesa abakulembeze boonaboona aba Buyudaaya n'aba Yerusalemu, beesolokeza gh'ali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaaja nabo mu isinzizo, aghalala n'abantu boonaboona ab'omu Buyudaaya, n'ab'omu Yerusalemu, ni bakabona, n'abalanzi, n'abantu abandi boonaboona abakologho n'ababuliidho. Agho nga bali kuwulira, yaasoma ebyali mu kitabo eky'endagaano ekyazuulibwa mu isinzizo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga Yosia yaayemerera mu kifo kye, yaakola endagaano mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda, nga bw'aidha okugemanga amateeka n'ebiragiro bye n'omutima gwe gwonagwona era n'omwoyo gwe gwonagwona, era atuukirizenga ebiri mu ndagaano eyo, nga bwe byaghandiikibwa mu kitabo ekyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho yaakubiriza abantu ba Benjamini n'abantu boonaboona abaaligho mu Yerusalemu, bakakase nga bwe baidha okukuumanga endagaano eyo. Era abantu b'omu Yerusalemu baakuuma endagaano eyo eya Musengwa Katonda, Katonda wa badhaadha baibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia yaatoola ebyenhinhalwa byonabyona mu kiketezo ky'Abaisiraeli. Olwo yaaleetera Abaisiraeli boonaboona okugheereza Musengwa Katonda waibwe. Era ekiseera kyonakyona kye yamala nga mulamu, abantu tibaalekeraku naire okugheereza Musengwa Katonda, Katonda wa badhaadha baibwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
